  <h2>5. Third-party links and retailers</h2>
  <p>The site links to third-party websites, including retailers such as Amazon and Discount Tire, NHTSA and tire makers. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for their content, prices, stock, shipping, installation, returns, warranties or privacy practices. A link is not an endorsement. Any purchase is a transaction between you and the seller, under the seller’s terms. Some links are affiliate links; see the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>

  <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The text, design, code, rankings and presentation of TireMileage are owned by the site owner or used with permission, and are protected by applicable intellectual-property laws. You may view, quote briefly with attribution and link to our pages. Please do not copy or republish substantial portions of the site without permission, except for the dataset downloads, which carry their own license note on the <a href="/data/">data page</a>.</li>
    <li>The underlying UTQG tire-grade records come from the U.S. National Highway Traffic Safety Administration (NHTSA), a U.S. government source. We are not affiliated with or endorsed by NHTSA.</li>
    <li>Tire maker and retailer names, brands and logos belong to their respective owners and are used only to identify them. We are not affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed by any tire maker or retailer.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, TireMileage and its owner will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages, or for any loss of profits, data, or goodwill, or for any personal injury, property damage or other loss, arising out of or related to your use of, or inability to use, the site or reliance on its content, even if we have been told such damage is possible. To the extent liability cannot be excluded, our total liability for any claim related to the site is limited to the greatest extent the law allows. Some places do not allow certain exclusions, so parts of this section may not apply to you.</p>

  <h2>8. Changes to the site and these terms</h2>
  <p>We may change, suspend or remove any part of the site, and may update these terms, at any time. When we change the terms we update the “Last revised” date above. Continuing to use the site after a change means you accept the updated terms.</p>

  <h2>9. Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the jurisdiction in which the site owner is located, without regard to its conflict-of-law rules. If any part of these terms is found unenforceable, the rest remains in effect.</p>

